                                                "sense_id": "14581727-eaba-3144-9fcb-c48cf431b854",
                                                "text": "As has been mentioned, Darts of to-day is essentially a \"public-house game,\" and in pretty nearly every inn, club, or institute where it has a footing (and in which has it not!) will be found minor variations in play and often games that are peculiar to the locality or even to the \"school\" itself. […] And in this domestic circle, at all events, it is thought that this set of Rules will prove a useful guide when taken in conjunction with what has already been said as regards the board, its position, the hockey-line, etc."
                                            },
